---
import '@fontsource/anton/latin.css';
import '@fontsource-variable/archivo';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="it">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Trovatemi mette al lavoro il passaparola che hai già: recensioni, risposte e presenza locale in un unico sistema."
    />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow, noarchive" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#121210" />
    <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect width='64' height='64' fill='%23121210'/%3E%3Ctext x='32' y='44' text-anchor='middle' font-size='40' fill='%23f2b90f'%3E%E2%98%85%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E" />
    <title>Trovatemi.it ★ — Il passaparola, messo al lavoro.</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#contenuto">Vai al contenuto</a>

    <header class="topbar">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/master-home/" aria-label="Trovatemi.it, home">
        TROVATEMI<span aria-hidden="true">.IT ★</span>
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="Navigazione principale">
        <a href="#il-problema">Il problema</a>
        <a href="#come-funziona">Come funziona</a>
        <a href="#prezzo">€149/mese</a>
        <a class="nav-cta" href="/">Beauty Check <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main id="contenuto">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <img
          class="hero-photo"
          src="/images/master-home-goodbye.webp"
          alt="Una cliente saluta sorridendo la titolare di una piccola attività locale"
          width="1536"
          height="1024"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
        <div class="hero-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="hero-inner shell">
          <p class="eyebrow reveal reveal-1"><span>01</span> TROVATEMI.IT · PER ATTIVITÀ LOCALI</p>
          <h1 id="hero-title" class="reveal reveal-2">
            Hai già<br />clienti felici.
            <em>Fai in modo<br />che si veda.</em>
          </h1>
          <div class="hero-bottom reveal reveal-3">
            <p>Il passaparola c’è.<br /><strong>Solo che gira male.</strong></p>
            <a class="round-link" href="#il-problema" aria-label="Scopri perché il passaparola si perde">
              <span>SCOPRI<br />PERCHÉ</span><b aria-hidden="true">↓</b>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-offer" aria-label="Offerta Trovatemi">
          <span>21 giorni di trial</span>
          <strong>€0 durante il trial</strong>
          <span>Poi €149/mese</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="il-problema" class="scene-section section-dark">
        <div class="shell scene-grid">
          <div class="section-index" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
          <div class="scene-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-gold">LA SCENA CHE SUCCEDE OGNI GIORNO</p>
            <blockquote>“Mi sono trovata<br /><em>benissimo.</em>”</blockquote>
          </div>
          <ol class="scene-steps" aria-label="Cosa succede dopo il complimento">
            <li><span>Tu sorridi.</span><b>01</b></li>
            <li><span>Dici grazie.</span><b>02</b></li>
            <li><span>Lei paga.</span><b>03</b></li>
            <li><span>Esce.</span><b>04</b></li>
            <li class="scene-end"><span>Fine.</span><b>05</b></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
        <div class="lost-line" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>UN CLIENTE FELICE</span><i></i><b>NON DIVENTA UNA PROVA</b>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="receipt-section">
        <img
          src="/images/master-home-receipt.webp"
          alt="Uno scontrino resta sul bancone mentre una cliente sta per uscire"
          width="1730"
          height="909"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="receipt-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="shell receipt-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-gold">IL COMPLIMENTO È SUCCESSO DAVVERO</p>
          <h2>Peccato che<br /><em>Google non era lì.</em></h2>
          <p>Lo sapete in due: tu e la cliente.<br />Quella che ti sta cercando domani, no.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="gap-section section-gold" aria-labelledby="gap-title">
        <div class="shell">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span>03</span> QUELLO CHE NON SI VEDE</p>
          <div class="gap-grid">
            <div class="gap-number" aria-hidden="true">50</div>
            <h2 id="gap-title">clienti felici.</h2>
            <div class="gap-number gap-number-small" aria-hidden="true">4</div>
            <h2>recensioni.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="gap-question">
            <p>Dove sono finite</p>
            <strong>le altre 46?</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="comparison-section section-paper" aria-labelledby="comparison-title">
        <div class="shell comparison-grid">
          <div class="comparison-intro">
            <p class="eyebrow"><span>04</span> IL CONFRONTO CHE CONTA</p>
            <h2 id="comparison-title">Sei più bravo.</h2>
            <p>Ma chi non ti conosce può giudicare soltanto quello che vede.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="review-race" aria-label="Confronto tra numero di recensioni">
            <article class="race-row race-them">
              <div><span>LUI</span><strong>384</strong></div>
              <p>recensioni</p>
              <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </article>
            <article class="race-row race-you">
              <div><span>TU</span><strong>41</strong></div>
              <p>recensioni</p>
              <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="choice-question">
          <div class="shell">
            <p>Indovina chi sembra più bravo.</p>
            <span aria-hidden="true">★</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="come-funziona" class="work-section section-dark" aria-labelledby="work-title">
        <div class="shell work-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-gold"><span>05</span> COSA FA TROVATEMI</p>
          <h2 id="work-title">Le persone lo dicono.<br /><em>Noi lo facciamo lavorare.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="work-list shell">
          <article>
            <span class="work-number">01</span>
            <h3>Chiedi.</h3>
            <p>Ogni cliente riceve il momento giusto per lasciare una recensione vera.</p>
            <small>RICHIESTE · PROMEMORIA</small>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span class="work-number">02</span>
            <h3>Rispondi.</h3>
            <p>Le recensioni non restano lì da sole. Le risposte arrivano con ordine e costanza.</p>
            <small>RISPOSTE · PRESENZA</small>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span class="work-number">03</span>
            <h3>Riusa.</h3>
            <p>Le parole migliori dei clienti continuano a parlare di te anche sui tuoi canali.</p>
            <small>CONTENUTI · SOCIAL</small>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span class="work-number">04</span>
            <h3>Misura.</h3>
            <p>Vedi cosa parte, cosa si ferma e dove il passaparola può rendere di più.</p>
            <small>RISULTATI · PROSSIMA MOSSA</small>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="work-statement shell">
          <span aria-hidden="true">★</span>
          <p>Il passaparola che hai già.</p>
          <strong>Messo al lavoro.</strong>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="prezzo" class="price-section section-paper" aria-labelledby="price-title">
        <div class="shell price-grid">
          <div class="price-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow"><span>06</span> UNA SOLA OFFERTA. FINE.</p>
            <h2 id="price-title">21 giorni.<br />La tua attività.<br /><em>Zero teoria.</em></h2>
            <p>Mettiamo in moto Trovatemi sulla tua attività e guardiamo cosa succede davvero.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="price-card">
            <div class="trial-price">
              <span>DURANTE IL TRIAL</span>
              <strong>€0</strong>
              <p>per 21 giorni</p>
            </div>
            <div class="paid-price">
              <span>DOPO IL TRIAL</span>
              <strong>€149<small>/mese</small></strong>
              <p>per sede, salvo cancellazione</p>
            </div>
            <ul>
              <li>Un solo prodotto</li>
              <li>Carta richiesta all’attivazione</li>
              <li>Nessun costo durante il trial</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="demo" class="demo-section section-gold" aria-labelledby="demo-title">
        <div class="shell demo-grid">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow"><span>07</span> UNA DEMO, MA DELLA TUA ATTIVITÀ</p>
            <h2 id="demo-title">Niente slide.<br /><em>Partiamo da te.</em></h2>
          </div>
          <ol>
            <li><b>01</b><span>Apriamo quello che vede oggi un cliente.</span></li>
            <li><b>02</b><span>Guardiamo recensioni, risposte e presenza.</span></li>
            <li><b>03</b><span>Ti mostriamo dove Trovatemi entra in mezzo.</span></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="router section-paper" aria-labelledby="router-title">
        <div class="shell">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span>08</span> DA DOVE PARTIAMO?</p>
          <h2 id="router-title" class="sr-only">Scegli il percorso per la tua attività</h2>
          <div class="router-grid">
            <a class="route-card route-beauty" href="/">
              <span class="route-type">BEAUTY &amp; WELLNESS</span>
              <strong>Hai un salone, barber, centro estetico, nails, spa?</strong>
              <p>Fai il Beauty Check</p>
              <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b>
            </a>
            <a class="route-card route-local" href="#demo">
              <span class="route-type">ALTRA ATTIVITÀ LOCALE</span>
              <strong>Vuoi vedere Trovatemi sul tuo caso reale?</strong>
              <p>Guarda come funziona la demo</p>
              <b aria-hidden="true">↑</b>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer section-dark">
      <div class="shell footer-grid">
        <div class="footer-mark">TROVATEMI.IT <span aria-hidden="true">★</span></div>
        <p>Il passaparola che hai già.<br /><strong>Messo al lavoro.</strong></p>
        <div class="footer-meta">
          <span>H0 · PREVIEW ISOLATA</span>
          <span>UN PRODOTTO · €149/MESE</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    --ink: #121210;
    --paper: #f1ede2;
    --gold: #f2b90f;
    --gold-light: #ffd447;
    --white: #fffdf7;
    --muted: #77736a;
    --line-dark: rgba(255, 253, 247, .22);
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; background: var(--ink); }
  body { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); background: var(--paper); font-family: 'Archivo Variable', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; overflow-x: hidden; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  body::selection { color: var(--ink); background: var(--gold); }
  img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }
  a { color: inherit; }
  h1, h2, h3, p, blockquote { margin: 0; }
  h1, h2, h3, blockquote { font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.025em; line-height: .91; text-transform: uppercase; }
  em { color: var(--gold); font-style: normal; }
  .shell { width: min(1240px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin-inline: auto; }
  .section-dark { color: var(--white); background: var(--ink); }
  .section-paper { color: var(--ink); background: var(--paper); }
  .section-gold { color: var(--ink); background: var(--gold); }
  .skip-link { position: fixed; top: 10px; left: 10px; z-index: 100; padding: 12px 16px; color: var(--ink); background: var(--gold); font-weight: 900; transform: translateY(-160%); }
  .skip-link:focus { transform: none; }
  .sr-only { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0; }
  .eyebrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 26px; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .eyebrow > span { display: inline-grid; place-items: center; width: 34px; height: 34px; border: 1px solid currentColor; border-radius: 50%; letter-spacing: 0; }
  .eyebrow-gold { color: var(--gold); }

  .topbar { position: fixed; inset: 0 0 auto; z-index: 50; min-height: 78px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 30px; padding-inline: max(24px, calc((100vw - 1240px) / 2)); color: var(--white); background: rgba(18, 18, 16, .82); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 253, 247, .18); backdrop-filter: blur(14px); }
  .wordmark { font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 1.65rem; letter-spacing: .02em; line-height: 1; text-decoration: none; }
  .wordmark span { color: var(--gold); }
  nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; }
  nav a { font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: .09em; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .nav-cta { padding: 12px 15px; color: var(--ink); background: var(--gold); }
  .nav-cta span { margin-left: 7px; }

  .hero { position: relative; min-height: 100svh; display: grid; align-items: end; color: var(--white); background: var(--ink); isolation: isolate; }
  .hero-photo, .hero-shade { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -2; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
  .hero-photo { object-fit: cover; object-position: 58% center; }
  .hero-shade { z-index: -1; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(10, 10, 8, .95) 0%, rgba(10, 10, 8, .83) 36%, rgba(10, 10, 8, .18) 73%, rgba(10, 10, 8, .28) 100%), linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(10, 10, 8, .82) 0%, transparent 45%); }
  .hero-inner { padding-block: 150px 125px; }
  .hero .eyebrow { color: var(--gold); }
  .hero .eyebrow span { color: var(--white); }
  .hero h1 { max-width: 940px; font-size: clamp(5.2rem, 10.4vw, 10.4rem); }
  .hero h1 em { display: block; }
  .hero-bottom { max-width: 940px; display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 30px; margin-top: 42px; }
  .hero-bottom > p { font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.9vw, 1.45rem); }
  .hero-bottom strong { color: var(--gold); }
  .round-link { width: 100px; height: 100px; flex: 0 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 3px; padding: 19px; color: var(--ink); background: var(--gold); border-radius: 50%; font-size: .62rem; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.15; text-decoration: none; transition: transform .25s ease, background .25s ease; }
  .round-link:hover { background: var(--gold-light); transform: rotate(-5deg) scale(1.04); }
  .round-link b { font-size: 1.65rem; }
  .hero-offer { position: absolute; right: 0; bottom: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, auto); color: var(--ink); background: var(--gold); }
  .hero-offer > * { display: flex; align-items: center; min-height: 52px; padding: 0 20px; border-left: 1px solid rgba(18, 18, 16, .35); font-size: .68rem; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .hero-offer strong { font-weight: 900; }
  .reveal { animation: rise .75s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) both; }
  .reveal-2 { animation-delay: .08s; }
  .reveal-3 { animation-delay: .16s; }
  @keyframes rise { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); } }

  .scene-section { padding: 130px 0 0; }
  .scene-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 120px minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(320px, .75fr); gap: 50px; align-items: start; padding-bottom: 120px; }
  .section-index { color: var(--gold); font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 6rem; line-height: .8; }
  .scene-copy blockquote { font-size: clamp(4.4rem, 8vw, 8.8rem); }
  .scene-steps { list-style: none; margin: 53px 0 0; padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-dark); }
  .scene-steps li { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; padding: 17px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-dark); font-size: 1.02rem; }
  .scene-steps b { color: var(--gold); font-size: .7rem; }
  .scene-steps .scene-end { color: var(--ink); background: var(--gold); margin-top: 12px; padding-inline: 14px; border: 0; font-weight: 900; }
  .scene-steps .scene-end b { color: var(--ink); }
  .lost-line { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 28px; padding: 22px max(24px, calc((100vw - 1240px) / 2)); color: var(--ink); background: var(--gold); font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .lost-line i { height: 1px; background: currentColor; }

  .receipt-section { position: relative; min-height: 820px; display: grid; align-items: center; color: var(--white); background: var(--ink); isolation: isolate; }
  .receipt-section > img, .receipt-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -2; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center; }
  .receipt-overlay { z-index: -1; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(12, 12, 10, .94) 0%, rgba(12, 12, 10, .7) 46%, rgba(12, 12, 10, .08) 82%); }
  .receipt-copy h2 { max-width: 880px; font-size: clamp(5rem, 9vw, 9.5rem); }
  .receipt-copy > p:last-child { max-width: 550px; margin-top: 35px; font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.45rem); font-weight: 650; }

  .gap-section { padding: 120px 0 110px; overflow: hidden; }
  .gap-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; align-items: baseline; column-gap: 28px; border-top: 3px solid var(--ink); }
  .gap-grid h2 { padding-block: 30px 20px; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink); font-size: clamp(4.8rem, 10vw, 11rem); white-space: nowrap; }
  .gap-number { min-width: 270px; padding-block: 17px 10px; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink); font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(8rem, 18vw, 18rem); letter-spacing: -.06em; line-height: .9; }
  .gap-number-small { color: var(--white); }
  .gap-question { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 18px; padding-top: 38px; font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.4vw, 2rem); }
  .gap-question strong { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem); text-transform: uppercase; }

  .comparison-section { padding-top: 125px; }
  .comparison-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr; gap: 90px; align-items: end; padding-bottom: 100px; }
  .comparison-intro h2 { font-size: clamp(4.7rem, 8vw, 8.5rem); }
  .comparison-intro > p:last-child { max-width: 460px; margin-top: 30px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .review-race { display: grid; gap: 36px; }
  .race-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 10px; }
  .race-row > div { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 22px; }
  .race-row span { font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .16em; }
  .race-row strong { font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(5.5rem, 11vw, 11rem); line-height: .8; }
  .race-row p { align-self: end; color: var(--muted); font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .race-row i { grid-column: 1 / -1; height: 22px; background: var(--ink); }
  .race-you strong { color: var(--gold); }
  .race-you i { width: 11%; min-width: 42px; background: var(--gold); }
  .choice-question { color: var(--white); background: var(--ink); }
  .choice-question .shell { min-height: 190px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 30px; }
  .choice-question p { font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6.8rem); line-height: .95; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .choice-question span { color: var(--gold); font-size: 5rem; animation: turn 10s linear infinite; }
  @keyframes turn { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

  .work-section { padding: 140px 0 120px; }
  .work-heading h2 { max-width: 1150px; font-size: clamp(4.4rem, 8.6vw, 9rem); }
  .work-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); margin-top: 100px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-dark); border-left: 1px solid var(--line-dark); }
  .work-list article { position: relative; min-height: 390px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: clamp(28px, 4vw, 50px); border-right: 1px solid var(--line-dark); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-dark); transition: color .3s ease, background .3s ease; }
  .work-list article:hover { color: var(--ink); background: var(--gold); }
  .work-number { align-self: flex-end; color: var(--gold); font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 900; }
  .work-list article:hover .work-number { color: var(--ink); }
  .work-list h3 { margin-top: auto; font-size: clamp(4rem, 7vw, 7.5rem); }
  .work-list p { max-width: 500px; margin-top: 20px; color: rgba(255, 253, 247, .68); font-size: 1.08rem; }
  .work-list article:hover p { color: rgba(18, 18, 16, .75); }
  .work-list small { margin-top: 28px; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: .11em; }
  .work-statement { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 0 28px; align-items: center; padding-top: 100px; }
  .work-statement span { grid-row: span 2; color: var(--gold); font-size: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 10rem); }
  .work-statement p { font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2.6rem); }
  .work-statement strong { color: var(--gold); font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(4.5rem, 10vw, 10rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: .9; text-transform: uppercase; }

  .price-section { padding: 130px 0; }
  .price-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr .78fr; gap: 90px; align-items: center; }
  .price-copy h2 { font-size: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 8.5rem); }
  .price-copy h2 em { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--gold); text-decoration-thickness: .11em; text-underline-offset: .06em; }
  .price-copy > p:last-child { max-width: 560px; margin-top: 32px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .price-card { color: var(--white); background: var(--ink); box-shadow: 14px 14px 0 var(--gold); }
  .trial-price, .paid-price { padding: 34px; }
